# Phase 3 remoting audit continuation — 20260928T082851Z

- Continued Java 5.5.1 source review of `NettyRemotingClient.invokeSync`, `NettyRemotingAbstract.invoke0`/`invokeSyncImpl`, `ResponseFuture`, callback ordering and pending completion. Confirmed sync send failures (including encode/write failure) are wrapped as `RemotingSendRequestException`; sync timeout applies the configured close-socket heuristic. A sync-specific classified send error must close the acquired generation without changing the future/callback `invoke` behavior.
- Corrected `invoke_sync` socket-close behavior for classified send failures during encode, write, GO_AWAY terminal handling and GO_AWAY retry failure. Applied timeout close policy to write-stage timeout as well as response timeout and retained the existing close heuristic. Retry recursion disables its own sync-close action so the outer invocation applies close to the original generation after retry completion, matching Java's wrapper/channel scope.
- Added scripted loopback test `p3_sync_encoding_failure_maps_to_send_request_and_closes_socket`, asserting Java-category error and peer EOF without a frame. Updated the inventory sync-invoke row to describe the narrowed behavior and tests.
- Focused validation passed: `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-remoting --test transport --offline p3_sync_ -- --test-threads=1` (5 tests); `... p3_go_away ...` (5 tests); new encode-failure test (1 test); `git diff --check`.
- Full current-tree gates passed: `cargo test --workspace --offline -- --test-threads=1` (81 transport tests and all other workspace tests), `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --offline -- -D warnings`, `cargo fmt --all --check`, `python3 scripts/check-workspace-metadata.py`, `python3 tests/differential/compare.py --self-test`, and `git diff --check`.
- Re-read the English and Traditional Chinese Phase 3 plans: local P3-V01/V02/V03/U01 evidence only; P3-V04 stays pending Phase 19. This is not a complete inventory, final diff or acceptance-criteria audit: other error/remark, callback, timeout/admission branches and final rlog reconciliation remain open. Do not accept Phase 3, commit, or start Phase 4 yet.
